Find vertical climb rate at an altitude
oFind air density ρ at the altitude
oCompute available engine power [installed power]
oCompute required power for hover:
[Main rotor power (accounting for fuselage download) + Tail rotor power]
oCompute Excess Power = Installed power – Required power for hover
oMax climb rate = Excess power/gross weight
oService ceiling ➔ Max climb rate = 100ft/min
oAbsolute ceiling ➔ Max climb rate = 0
