Forward flight performance
o Power requirement includes:
o Main rotor power
o Induced power (accounting for thrust = vehicle weight + downwash on fuselage) [Pi]
o Profile power [Po]
o Tail rotor power (induced + profile power)
o Fuselage parasite drag power (Drag × forward speed)
o Engine power transmission and installation Losses
oMax speed is when:
o Power required for forward flight = power available
oClimb rate = Excess power/Gross weight
where excess power = installed power – power for forward flight
